          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Zung Jung is a modern Mahjong ruleset designed around transparent balanced scoring while preserving traditional draw-discard meld play. It is widely used when players want a structured alternative to many divergent house systems."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Zung Jung was designed as a coherent modern scoring framework for Mahjong with explicit pattern values and clear hand evaluation logic."
            }
          ]
        },
